# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# ORACLE V2 — API KEYS CONFIGURATION
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your keys.
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# All keys are OPTIONAL — the engine works without them but with
# reduced accuracy. Free tiers are sufficient for all.
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── The Odds API (live betting odds from 40+ bookmakers) ──
# Free: 500 requests/month | Sign up: https://the-odds-api.com
ODDS_API_KEY=

# ── Football-Data.org (EPL/UCL/LaLiga fixtures + standings) ──
# Free: 10 requests/minute | Sign up: https://www.football-data.org/client/register
FOOTBALL_DATA_KEY=

# ── NewsData.io (injury/team news for any sport) ──
# Free: 200 requests/day | Sign up: https://newsdata.io/register
NEWSDATA_KEY=

# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# NO KEY NEEDED (these work out of the box):
#   - ESPN API (free, public)
#   - Open-Meteo (weather, free)
#   - TheSportsDB (free with key=3)
#   - CricSheet (free data downloads)
#   - OpenF1 (free F1 data)
#   - Nominatim/OSM (geocoding, free)
#   - NBA API (free)
#   - MLB Stats API (free)
#   - NHL API (free)
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
